      ],
      "description": "Cursor start: the first scan line of the cursor and how it blinks.",
      "behaviour": "Bits 4 to 0 give the first cursor scan line. Bits 6 and 5 select the cursor mode: 00 always on, 01 off, 10 blinking fast, 11 blinking slowly.",
